    "about": "View the exact recorded worker display read-only (outside tmux only). Default: native terminal client. --json or --output json|jsonl validates and returns a descriptor without attaching. Never creates a tmux server. Example: taskfleet run attach 01arz3ndektsv4rrffq69g5fav --json",
